**AIService**

Defined in `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto:11-19`:

```proto
service AIService {
  // Transcribe transcribes an audio file using an instance AI provider.
  rpc Transcribe(TranscribeRequest) returns (TranscribeResponse) {
    option (google.api.http) = {
      post: "/api/v1/ai:transcribe"
      body: "*"
    };
    option (google.api.method_signature) = "audio";
  }
}
```

It's the only RPC on that service, exposed over HTTP as `POST /api/v1/ai:transcribe`, with `TranscribeRequest`/`TranscribeResponse` messages declared in the same file (lines 22–46).
